      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  T A B L E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

      *----THE ITEM TABLE HAS AN OCCURS OF 84 TIMES BECAUSE THE MAXIMUM
      *----NUMBER OF ITEMS ON A RECEIVER IS CURRENTLY 12 AND THE MAXIMUM
      *----NUMBER OF PO'S RELATED TO A FREIGHT BILL IS 7  (7 * 12 = 84).
      *----WE CURRENTLY DO NOT APPLY FREIGHT ACROSS MORE THAN JUST THE
      *----FIRST PO. BUT IF THAT CHANGES, THE TABLE WILL BE READY.

       01  ITEM-TABLE.
           05  ITEM-TABLE-ENTRY    OCCURS 84 TIMES.
               10  TBL-PO-RLS.
                   15  TBL-PO      PIC X(7).
                   15  TBL-RLS     PIC X(3).
               10  TBL-RCVR        PIC X(4).
               10  TBL-CODE        PIC X(8).
               10  TBL-ITEM        PIC X(4).
               10  TBL-UM          PIC X(2).
               10  TBL-QTY         PIC S9(10).
               10  TBL-FRT-PCT     PIC S9V9(5).
               10  TBL-APPL-AMT    PIC S9(7)V99.
               10  TBL-PAID-AMT    PIC S9(7)V99.
               10  TBL-FRT-TAX     PIC S9(7)V99.

