       COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       1-MAIN SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       1-0-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 1-1-HSK.

           PERFORM 7-PROCESS-FREIGHT THRU 7-EXIT
              UNTIL MORE-FILES = "N".

           PERFORM 1-2-CLOSE-FILES.

           GOBACK.

       1-1-HSK.

           ACCEPT TYPE-OF-FILE.

           MOVE "TFRTPROC" TO FROM-PGM-NAME.

      *----OVERRIDE HOLDDUMMY WITH FRTDATAFL/TISHOLD.
           CALL "QCMDEXC"  USING   OVRDBF-HLD-CMD  OVRDBF-HLD-LEN.

      *----OVERRIDE FRTERRFL WITH FRTDATAFL/DAILYERR.
           CALL "QCMDEXC"  USING   OVRDBF-ERR-CMD  OVRDBF-ERR-LEN.


           OPEN INPUT      DAPPLFRT-PO-I           DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                           DAPPLFRT-PCP-I          DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
                           DAPPLFRT-VS-I.

           OPEN I-O        DAPPLFRT-RRN-O          MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

           OPEN EXTEND     ERROR-O                 HOLDFRT-O
                           DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O.

           INITIALIZE MORE-FILES.

      *----AS OF MAR 93 THE CENTURY IS NOT AVAILABLE FROM THE SYSTEM.
      *----UNTIL THE SITUATION CHANGES, THE FOLLOWING CODING IS A
      *----TEMPORARY MEASURE. THIS CODING IS USED FOR ALL DATES IN
      *----THIS PROGRAM THAT NEED CONVERSION.

           ACCEPT CUR-SYSTEM-DATE FROM DATE.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY < "40"
              MOVE "20" TO CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO CUR-DATE-CC.

      *----GET STOREROOM DEPARTMENT AND CSAS FREIGHT DATE.

           MOVE "SDPT" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-STR-DEPT TO SAVE-STR-DEPT.
           MOVE MACCT-FRT-START-DATE TO SAVE-ST-DATE-YMD.
           IF SAVE-ST-DATE-YY < "40"
              MOVE "20" TO SAVE-ST-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO SAVE-ST-DATE-CC.

      *----DOES PLANT PAY TAX ON FREIGHT?

           MOVE "MTED" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-PAY-FRT-TAX      TO SAVE-PAY-FRT-TAX.

      *----GET THE LAST PFM SEQUENCE NUMBER CREATED.

           MOVE "FRT" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-CREATED TO SAVE-LAST-FILE-CREATED.

           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

       1-2-CLOSE-FILES.

           CLOSE           DAPPLFRT-PO-I           DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                           DAPPLFRT-PCP-I          DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
                           DAPPLFRT-RRN-O          DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O
                           MACCOUNT-INFO-O     DAPPLFRT-VS-I
                           ERROR-O                 HOLDFRT-O.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       7-PROCESS-FREIGHT SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       7-0-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 7-1-HSK.

           IF NOT PROCESSING-HOLD-FILE
              PERFORM 7-4-PROCESS-OR-HOLD THRU 7-4-EXIT.

           PERFORM 7-6-PROCESS-FREIGHT-RECS THRU 7-6-EXIT
              UNTIL FREIGHT-EOF = "Y".

           PERFORM 7-7-SET-FLAGS-AND-SWITCHES.

           GO TO 7-EXIT.

       7-1-HSK.

           INITIALIZE  FREIGHT-EOF, FREIGHT-FILE-FLAG.

      *----BEFORE EACH FILE IS PROCESSED FIND OUT WHERE
      *----THE MONTH END ACTIVITIES STAND.

           MOVE "MTED" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-AVG-COST-CALC-SW TO SAVE-AVG-COST-SW.
           MOVE MACCT-FINCLS-SW        TO SAVE-FINAL-CLOSE-SW.
           MOVE "MY"   TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH            TO SAVE-CUR-ACCT-MM.
           MOVE MACCT-YEAR             TO SAVE-CUR-ACCT-YY.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

      *----DECIDE WHICH FREIGHT FILE TO PROCESS.
      *----THE REGULAR DAILY FRT FILE OR THE MONTH END HOLD FILE.

           IF TYPE-OF-FILE = "1"
              PERFORM 7-10-GET-NEXT-FRT-FILE.
           IF TYPE-OF-FILE = "2"
              PERFORM 7-11-GET-HOLD-FILE.

           OPEN INPUT FREIGHT-I.

       7-10-GET-NEXT-FRT-FILE.

      *----CALCULATE NEXT SEQUENCE NUMBER TO PROCESS.

           MOVE "FRT" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-READ TO SAVE-SEQ-NUM.
           ADD 1 TO SAVE-SEQ-NUM.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

      *----CHECK FOR MEMBER IN FRTDATAFL WITH THIS SEQ NUM.

           INITIALIZE RTN-CODE.
           CALL "FRTCHKOBJ" USING   SAVE-SEQ-ALPHA   RTN-CODE.

           IF RTN-CODE = "1"
              IF SAVE-SEQ-NUM > SAVE-LAST-FILE-CREATED
                 MOVE "N" TO MORE-FILES
                 GO TO 7-EXIT
              ELSE
                 MOVE "MISSING FREIGHT MBR IN FRTDATAFL"
                                            TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE "EXPECTING SEQ "      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE SAVE-SEQ-NUM          TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 MOVE "LAST CREATED"        TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                 MOVE SAVE-LAST-FILE-CREATED TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *----OVERRIDE FRTDUMMY WITH FRTDATAFL/FRTXXXX

           MOVE SAVE-SEQ-ALPHA TO OVRDBF-FRT-SEQ.
           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING   OVRDBF-FRT-CMD   OVRDBF-FRT-LEN.

       7-11-GET-HOLD-FILE.

           ACCEPT FIRST-TIME-PROCESSED FROM TIME.
      *    DISPLAY "AFTER ACCEPT FIRST-TIME = " FIRST-TIME-PROCESSED.

      *----OVERRIDE FRTDUMMY WITH FRTDATAFL/TISHOLD1

           CALL "QCMDEXC" USING OVRDBF-HLD1-CMD  OVRDBF-HLD1-LEN.
           MOVE "N" TO MORE-FILES.

       7-4-PROCESS-OR-HOLD.

      *------------------------------------------------------------------------
      *----ALL FREIGHT CHARGES FOR A CALENDAR MONTH NEED TO BE PROCESSED
      *----DURING THAT MONTH NO MATTER WHEN THE PLANT'S ACTUAL MONTH END
      *----DATE OCCURS. IF FOR SOME REASON THE CHARGES CAN'T BE PROCESSED
      *----THEY WILL BE WRITTEN TO HOLD. THE HOLD FILE IS PROCESSED AS
      *----THE LAST STEP OF FINAL CLOSING.
      *----
      *----FREIGHT WILL BE PROCESSED WHEN:
      *----
      *----   THE FILE RECEIVED IS FOR THE CURRENT ACCOUNTING MONTH
      *----   AND NO MONTH END ACTIVITY HAS OCCURED.
      *----
      *----   THE FILE RECEIVED IS FOR THE CURRENT ACCOUNTING MONTH BUT
      *----   AVERAGE COSTING HAS OCCURED (SW = "Y").  THE AVG-COST-SW
      *----   WILL BE RESET TO FORCE IT TO OCCUR AGAIN AFTER THE FREIGHT
      *----   HAS BEEN PROCESSED.
      *----
      *----FREIGHT WILL BE WRITTEN TO HOLD WHEN:
      *----
      *----   THE FILE RECEIVED IS FOR THE CURRENT ACCOUNTING MONTH
      *----   BUT FINAL CLOSE HAS ALREADY STARTED.
      *----
      *----   THE FILE RECEIVED IS FOR THE FOLLOWING ACCOUNTING MONTH
      *----   BUT IT HAS BEEN RECEIEVED BEFORE THE COMPLETION OF THE CURRENT
      *----   MONTH END CLOSING ACTIVITIES. (FOR EXAMPLE, THE CLOSE DATE
      *----   IS THE 3RD WORK DAY.)
      *----
      *----   THE FILE RECEIVED CONTAINS ONLY RATED RECORDS AND ANY OF
      *----   THE FOLLOWING HAS OCCURED:
      *----
      *----      AVERAGE COSTING . . . . . . MACCT-FRT-AVG-COST-CALC-SW = "Y"
      *----          OR
      *----      FINAL CLOSE STARTED . . . . MACCT-FINCLS-SW = "Y"
      *----          OR
      *----      ALL FILES FOR THE . . . . . MACCT-FRT-MONTH-COMPLETED-SW = "Y"
      *----      CURRENT ACCOUNTING
      *----      MONTH HAVE BEEN
      *----      RECEIVED.
      *------------------------------------------------------------------------

           READ FREIGHT-I INTO BUF-FREIGHT.
           IF FREIGHT-TRAN-CODE NOT = "01"
              MOVE "MISSING HDR*7-4-POH" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "MISSING HDR IN" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE SAVE-SEQ-NUM     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "P" TO FREIGHT-FILE-FLAG.

           IF FREIGHT-PAYMENT-DATE = SPACES
              MOVE "FRT" TO MACCT-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O
              IF MACCT-FRT-MONTH-COMPLETED-SW = "Y"
                OR SAVE-AVG-COST-SW = "Y"
                OR SAVE-FINAL-CLOSE-SW = "Y"
                 PERFORM 7-40-WRITE-TO-HOLD
                 GO TO 7-4-EXIT
              END-IF
              PERFORM 9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

           IF FREIGHT-PAYMENT-DATE (3:4) > SAVE-CUR-ACCT-DATE
              PERFORM 7-40-WRITE-TO-HOLD
              MOVE "FRT" TO MACCT-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O
              MOVE "Y" TO MACCT-FRT-MONTH-COMPLETED-SW
              PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-MACCOUNT-INFO-O
              GO TO 7-4-EXIT.

           IF FREIGHT-PAYMENT-DATE (3:4) <= SAVE-CUR-ACCT-DATE
              IF SAVE-FINAL-CLOSE-SW = "Y"
                 PERFORM 7-40-WRITE-TO-HOLD
                 GO TO 7-4-EXIT
              END-IF
              IF SAVE-AVG-COST-SW = "Y"
                 MOVE "MTED" TO MACCT-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O
                 INITIALIZE MACCT-AVG-COST-CALC-SW
                            MACCT-VOUCHER-SENT-SW
                            MACCT-BALWOFF-SW
                            MACCT-LIFORPT-SW
                 PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-MACCOUNT-INFO-O
                 GO TO 7-4-EXIT.

       7-4-EXIT.  EXIT.

       7-40-WRITE-TO-HOLD.

           MOVE "H" TO FREIGHT-FILE-FLAG.

           PERFORM UNTIL FREIGHT-EOF = "Y"
              IF FREIGHT-TRAN-CODE = "02" OR "03"
                 WRITE HOLDFRT-REC-O FROM BUF-FREIGHT
              END-IF
              IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                 MOVE "WRITE HOLDFRT*7-6-FCFR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE "PROBLEM REC" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE FREIGHT-PO-NUM TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                 MOVE "IN FILE (SEQ)" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
                 MOVE SAVE-SEQ-ALPHA TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (5)
                 PERFORM 9999-BLOWUP
              END-IF
              READ FREIGHT-I INTO BUF-FREIGHT
                 AT END MOVE "Y" TO FREIGHT-EOF
                        CLOSE FREIGHT-I
              END-READ
           END-PERFORM.

       7-7-SET-FLAGS-AND-SWITCHES.
           MOVE "FRT" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

      *----TYPE-OF-FILE VALUE IS ACCEPTED IN PARA 1-1-HSK.
      *----WHEN VALUE IS...   88 LEVEL...                IS TRUE.
      *----       1           PROCESSING-FREIGHT-FILE
      *----       2           PROCESSING-HOLD-FILE

           IF PROCESSING-HOLD-FILE
              MOVE MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-READ
                            TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-PROCESSED
              MOVE CUR-DATE TO MACCT-FRT-FIRST-DATE-PROCESSED
              MOVE FIRST-TIME-PROCESSED
                            TO MACCT-FRT-FIRST-TIME-PROCESSED
              MOVE CUR-DATE TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-DATE-PROCESSED
              ACCEPT CUR-TIME FROM TIME
              MOVE CUR-TIME TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-TIME-PROCESSED
              INITIALIZE MACCT-FRT-MONTH-COMPLETED-SW.

           IF PROCESSING-FREIGHT-FILE
              MOVE SAVE-SEQ-ALPHA TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-READ
              IF FREIGHT-PROCESSED
                 MOVE SAVE-SEQ-ALPHA TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-FILE-PROCESSED
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-DATE-PROCESSED
                 ACCEPT CUR-TIME FROM TIME
                 MOVE CUR-TIME TO MACCT-FRT-LAST-TIME-PROCESSED.

           PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.

      *THIS SECTION PERFORMED FOR EACH INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD.

       7-6-PROCESS-FREIGHT-RECS.

           READ FREIGHT-I INTO BUF-FREIGHT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO FREIGHT-EOF.
           IF FREIGHT-EOF = "Y"
              CLOSE FREIGHT-I
              GO TO 7-6-EXIT.
           IF FREIGHT-TRAN-CODE NOT = "02" AND NOT = "03"
              GO TO 7-6-PROCESS-FREIGHT-RECS.

      *----IS INCOMING FREIGHT REC PAID OR RATED?

      *----RECORD TYPES EQUAL TO "Z" MEAN THAT THE RECORD CAME FROM TIS
      *----AS A "P" FOR PAYMENT.  BUT BECAUSE IT HAD A PO AND AN OLD PAID
      *----DATE, THE PROGRAM TFRTWRKPFM CONVERTED IT TO RATED BUT USED
      *----"Z" INSTEAD OF "R" TO INDICATE THE CHANGE. SEE TFRTWRKPFM FOR
      *----MORE EXPLANATION.

           INITIALIZE FREIGHT-TYPE.
           IF FREIGHT-REC-TYPE = "R" OR "Z"
              SET FREIGHT-RATED TO TRUE.
           IF FREIGHT-REC-TYPE = "P"
              SET FREIGHT-PAID  TO TRUE.

      *----EDIT FREIGHT REC FOR ERRORS.

           IF FREIGHT-REC-TYPE  = "R" OR "P" OR "Z"
              CONTINUE
           ELSE
              MOVE "INVALID FREIGHT-REC-TYPE" TO ERR-MSG
              MOVE "761" TO ERR-CODE
              MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
              MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
              WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
              GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

           IF FREIGHT-PAID-DATE > SPACES
              IF FREIGHT-PAID-DATE LESS THAN SAVE-START-DATE
                 MOVE "FREIGHT-PAID-DATE LT MACCT-FRT-START-DATE"
                    TO ERR-MSG
                 MOVE "762" TO ERR-CODE
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
                 MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
                 WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
                 GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

           IF FREIGHT-CHARGES IS NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE "FREIGHT-CHARGES NOT NUMERIC" TO ERR-MSG
              MOVE "763" TO ERR-CODE
              MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
              MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
              WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
              GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

           IF FREIGHT-RATED
              IF FREIGHT-PO-13 = SPACES
                 MOVE "RATED RECORD MISSING PO" TO ERR-MSG
                 MOVE "764" TO ERR-CODE
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
                 MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
                 WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
                 GO TO 7-6-EXIT
              END-IF

      *       IF FREIGHT-MODE-CODE = "RR"
      *          IF FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
      *             OR FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM = SPACES
      *             MOVE "RATED RR REC MISSING SHIP-DATE/VEH-NUM"
      *                TO ERR-MSG
      *             MOVE "765" TO ERR-CODE
      *             MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
      *             MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
      *             WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
      *             GO TO 7-6-EXIT
      *       END-IF.

           IF FREIGHT-PAID
              IF FREIGHT-PAID-DATE = SPACES
                 MOVE "MISSING PAID DATE ON PAID REC" TO ERR-MSG
                 MOVE "766" TO ERR-CODE
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
                 MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
                 WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
                 GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

           IF FREIGHT-PO-NUM > SPACES
              IF FREIGHT-PO-RCVR = SPACES OR "000"
                 MOVE "RECORD'S PO MISSING RCVR NUMBER" TO ERR-MSG
                 MOVE "767" TO ERR-CODE
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
                 MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
                 WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
                 GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

      *------- IF A PAID RECORD'S PAY TO AND DELIVER CARRIERS
      *------- ARE DIFFERENT, SET SWITCH TO TRY AND MATCH AGAINST
      *------- THE RATED CARRIER IF NONE AGAINST THE PAID CARRIER
      *------- IS FOUND.
           IF FREIGHT-PAID
               IF FREIGHT-DELV-CARR NOT = FREIGHT-PAY-CARR
                   MOVE "Y"       TO DIFF-DLV-PD-CARR-SW
               ELSE
                   MOVE "N"       TO DIFF-DLV-PD-CARR-SW.

      *----IF THE RECORD IS OKAY USE THE FOLLOWING TIME TO RECORD WHEN
      *----IT WILL BE APPLIED.

           ACCEPT CUR-TIME FROM TIME.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------------
      *----IF FREIGHT REC IS...   THEN MATCH TO DAPPLFRT REC ON...
      *----------------------------------------------------------------------
      *----   A RAIL SHIPMENT       VEH NO        & SHIP DATE (+/- 3 DAYS) OR
      *----                         CARR & PRO    & SHIP DATE (+/- 3 DAYS).
      *----------------------------------------------------------------------
      *----   ANY OTHER TYPE        PO NUMBER                              OR
      *----                         CARR & PRO    & SHIP DATE              OR
      *----                         VEH NO & CARR & SHIP DATE.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------------
      *----IF PAID RECORD AND NO MATCH IS FOUND TO THE PAID CARRIER,
      *----TRY TO MATCH WITH THE RATED CARRIER, IF IT IS DIFFERENT THAN THE
      *----PAID CARRIER.       11/14/1996
      *----------------------------------------------------------------------

           INITIALIZE TBL-IX MATCH-FLAG DAPPLFRT-EOF DAPPLFRT-TYPE.

      *----RAIL SHIPMENTS

           IF FREIGHT-MODE-CODE = "RR"
              IF FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE > SPACES
                 PERFORM 7-50-CALC-SHIP-DATE-RANGE
      *-------SEARCH 1: VEH NO AND SHIP DATE(+/- 3)
                 PERFORM 7-51-MATCH-ON-VEH-SHIP
      *-------SEARCH 2: CARRIER/PRO NO AND SHIP DATE(+/- 3)
                 IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND
                    INITIALIZE MATCH-FLAG
                    IF FREIGHT-PAID
                       PERFORM 7-52-MATCH-ON-PD-CARR-PRO-SHIP
      *----------------- SEARCH AGAINST RATED CARRIER IF PAID NOT FOUND
      *----------------- AND RATED AND PAID CARRIERS ARE DIFFERENT.
                       IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND
                           IF DIFF-DLV-PD-CARR-SW = "Y"
                               INITIALIZE MATCH-FLAG
                               PERFORM 7-52B-MATCH-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP
                           END-IF
                       END-IF
                    END-IF
                    IF FREIGHT-RATED
                       PERFORM 7-53-MATCH-ON-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF

      *----OTHER SHIPMENTS

           ELSE
      *-------SEARCH 1: PO NUMBER
              PERFORM 7-54-MATCH-ON-PO
      *-------SEARCH 2: CARRIER/PRO NO AND SHIP DATE
              IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND
                 INITIALIZE MATCH-FLAG
                 IF FREIGHT-PAID
                    PERFORM 7-55-MATCH-ON-PD-CARR-PRO-SHIP
      *--------------- SEARCH AGAINST RATED CARRIER IF PAID NOT FOUND
      *--------------- AND RATED AND PAID CARRIERS ARE DIFFERENT.
                    IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND
                        IF DIFF-DLV-PD-CARR-SW = "Y"
                           INITIALIZE MATCH-FLAG
                           PERFORM 7-55B-MATCH-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP
                        END-IF
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
                 IF FREIGHT-RATED
                    PERFORM 7-56-MATCH-ON-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP
                 END-IF
              END-IF
      *-------SEARCH 3: VEH NO, SHIP DATE AND CARRIER
              IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND
                 INITIALIZE MATCH-FLAG
                 IF FREIGHT-PAID
                    PERFORM 7-57-MATCH-ON-VEH-SHIP-PD-CARR
      *--------------- SEARCH AGAINST RATED CARRIER IF PAID NOT FOUND
      *--------------- AND RATED AND PAID CARRIERS ARE DIFFERENT.
                    IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND
                        IF DIFF-DLV-PD-CARR-SW = "Y"
                           INITIALIZE MATCH-FLAG
                           PERFORM 7-57B-MATCH-VEH-SHIP-RT-CARR
                        END-IF
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
                 IF FREIGHT-RATED
                    PERFORM 7-58-MATCH-ON-VEH-SHIP-RT-CARR.


      *----IS MATCHED DAPPLFRT REC PAID OR RATED?

           IF MATCH-FOUND
              IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE = SPACES
9409CK         AND DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE = SPACES
                 SET DAPPLFRT-RATED TO TRUE
              ELSE
                 SET DAPPLFRT-PAID  TO TRUE.

      *----PROCESS FREIGHT RECORD.

           IF MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF FREIGHT-PAID
                 IF FREIGHT-PO-13 = SPACES
      *-------------NO PO SO HAVE TO HANDLE THIS REC MANUALLY
                    PERFORM 7-60-WRITE-MANL-TO-DAPPLFRT
                 ELSE
      *-------------HAVE PO SO CAN APPLY AMT DIRECTLY
                    PERFORM 7-61-APPLY-PAID-NOT-RATED
                 END-IF
              END-IF

              IF FREIGHT-RATED
                  PERFORM 7-62-APPLY-RATED-NOT-PAID.

           IF MATCH-FOUND

              IF FREIGHT-PAID
                 IF DAPPLFRT-RATED
                   PERFORM 7-63-APPLY-PAID-AFTER-RATED
                 END-IF
                 IF DAPPLFRT-PAID
      *-------------SINCE BOTH ARE PAID, IS THIS ANOTHER PAYMENT?
                    PERFORM 7-64-APPLY-EXTRA-PAYMENT
                 END-IF
              END-IF

              IF FREIGHT-RATED
                 IF DAPPLFRT-RATED
                    PERFORM 7-65-PROCESS-NEW-RATED-AMT
                 END-IF
                 IF DAPPLFRT-PAID
                    IF DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
      *----------------PAID REC IS A MANL BUT CAN NOW APPLY
                       PERFORM 7-66-APPLY-MANL-NOW-RATED
                    ELSE
      *----------------RATED FREIGHT REC IS FOLLOWING A PAYMENT
                       GO TO 7-6-EXIT
                    END-IF.

       7-6-EXIT.  EXIT.

       7-EXIT.  EXIT.

       7-50-CALC-SHIP-DATE-RANGE.

      *----CONVERT FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE TO JULIAN.

           INITIALIZE JULIAN-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-YYYY TO JULIAN-YYYY.
           CALL "CJULIAN" USING FREIGHT-SHIP-YYYY, FREIGHT-SHIP-MM,
                                FREIGHT-SHIP-DD,   JULIAN-DDD.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE TO JUL-FRT-SHIP-DATE.

      *----FIND ALLOWABLE JULIAN DATE RANGE FOR MATCHING PURPOSES.
      *----FOR +3/-3, NORMALLY THE DATE RANGE WILL BE 7 DAYS. IF A LEAP
      *----YEAR IS INVOLVED, THE DATE RANGE WILL INCREASE TO 8 DAYS.

      *----FIND MINIMUM DATE ALLOWED.

           MOVE JUL-FRT-SHIP-DATE TO JULIAN-DATE.
           COMPUTE JULIAN-DDD = JULIAN-DDD - 3.
           IF JULIAN-DDD < 001
              ADD 365 TO JULIAN-DDD
              SUBTRACT 1 FROM JULIAN-YYYY.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE TO JUL-MIN-SHIP-DATE.

      *----FIND MAXIMUM DATE ALLOWED.

           MOVE JUL-FRT-SHIP-DATE TO JULIAN-DATE.
           COMPUTE JULIAN-DDD = JULIAN-DDD + 3.
           IF JULIAN-DDD > 365
              SUBTRACT 365 FROM JULIAN-DDD
              ADD 1 TO JULIAN-YYYY.
           MOVE JULIAN-DATE TO JUL-MAX-SHIP-DATE.

      *----CONVERT JULAIN DATE RANGE TO YYYYMMDD FORMAT.

           INITIALIZE MIN-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE JUL-MIN-SHIP-DATE TO JULIAN-DATE.
           MOVE JULIAN-YYYY TO MIN-SHIP-YYYY.
           CALL "CJULIAN" USING JULIAN-YYYY,   MIN-SHIP-MM,
                                MIN-SHIP-DD,   JULIAN-DDD.

           INITIALIZE MAX-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE JUL-MAX-SHIP-DATE TO JULIAN-DATE.
           MOVE JULIAN-YYYY TO MAX-SHIP-YYYY.
           CALL "CJULIAN" USING JULIAN-YYYY,   MAX-SHIP-MM,
                                MAX-SHIP-DD,   JULIAN-DDD.

       7-51-MATCH-ON-VEH-SHIP.
           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM EQUAL SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO RAIL-CAR-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-CAR
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-RAIL-CAR = FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE >= MIN-SHIP-DATE
                    AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE <= MAX-SHIP-DATE
                       SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                       MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-52-MATCH-ON-PD-CARR-PRO-SHIP.

      *----THE INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD'S PAID FIELDS ARE
      *----MATCHED TO THE DAPPLFRT RECORD'S RATED FIELDS.

           IF FREIGHT-PAY-CARR EQUAL SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-FB-NUM EQUAL SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-RCP
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER = FREIGHT-PAY-CARR
                AND DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO = FREIGHT-FB-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE >= MIN-SHIP-DATE
                    AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE <= MAX-SHIP-DATE
                       SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                       MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

      *------ IF NO MATCH IS FOUND WITH THE PAID CARRIER, AND
      *------ THE PAID AND RATED CARRIERS ARE DIFFERENT, TRY
      *------ TO MATCH TO THE RATED CARRIER.
       7-52B-MATCH-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP.

      *----THE INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD'S PAID FIELDS ARE
      *----MATCHED TO THE DAPPLFRT RECORD'S RATED FIELDS.

           IF FREIGHT-DELV-CARR EQUAL SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-FB-NUM EQUAL SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-RCP
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER = FREIGHT-DELV-CARR
                AND DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO = FREIGHT-FB-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE >= MIN-SHIP-DATE
                    AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE <= MAX-SHIP-DATE
                       SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                       MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-53-MATCH-ON-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP.

      *----THE INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD'S RATED FIELDS ARE
      *----MATCHED TO THE DAPPLFRT RECORD'S PAID FIELDS.

           IF FREIGHT-DELV-CARR EQUAL SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-FB-NUM EQUAL SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-PCP
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER = FREIGHT-DELV-CARR
                AND DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO = FREIGHT-FB-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE >= MIN-SHIP-DATE
                    AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE <= MAX-SHIP-DATE
                       SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                       MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-54-MATCH-ON-PO.

           IF FREIGHT-PO-13 EQUAL SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14 TO PO-14-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-PO
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                 MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN.

       7-55-MATCH-ON-PD-CARR-PRO-SHIP.

      *----THE INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD'S PAID FIELDS ARE
      *----MATCHED TO THE DAPPLFRT RECORD'S RATED FIELDS.

           IF FREIGHT-PAY-CARR    = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-FB-NUM    = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-RCP
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER = FREIGHT-PAY-CARR
                AND DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO = FREIGHT-FB-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE = FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE
                    SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                    MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

      *------ IF NO MATCH IS FOUND WITH THE PAID CARRIER, AND
      *------ THE PAID AND RATED CARRIERS ARE DIFFERENT, TRY
      *------ TO MATCH TO THE RATED CARRIER.
       7-55B-MATCH-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP.

      *----THE INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD'S PAID FIELDS ARE
      *----MATCHED TO THE DAPPLFRT RECORD'S RATED FIELDS.

           IF FREIGHT-DELV-CARR   = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-FB-NUM    = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-RCP
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER = FREIGHT-DELV-CARR
                AND DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO = FREIGHT-FB-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE = FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE
                    SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                    MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-56-MATCH-ON-RT-CARR-PRO-SHIP.

      *----THE INCOMING FREIGHT RECORD'S RATED FIELDS ARE
      *----MATCHED TO THE DAPPLFRT RECORD'S PAID FIELDS.

           IF FREIGHT-DELV-CARR   = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-FB-NUM    = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-PCP
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND

              IF DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER = FREIGHT-DELV-CARR
                AND DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO = FREIGHT-FB-NUM
                 IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE = FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE
                    SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                    MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-57-MATCH-ON-VEH-SHIP-PD-CARR.

           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-PAY-CARR  = SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO RAIL-CAR-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE TO DATE-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-VS
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND
              IF DAPPL-RAIL-CAR = FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM
                AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE = FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE
                 IF DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER = FREIGHT-PAY-CARR
                    SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                    MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

      *------ IF NO MATCH IS FOUND WITH THE PAID CARRIER, AND
      *------ THE PAID AND RATED CARRIERS ARE DIFFERENT, TRY
      *------ TO MATCH TO THE RATED CARRIER.
       7-57B-MATCH-VEH-SHIP-RT-CARR.

           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-DELV-CARR  = SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO RAIL-CAR-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE TO DATE-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-VS
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND
              IF DAPPL-RAIL-CAR = FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM
                AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE = FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE
                 IF DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER = FREIGHT-DELV-CARR
                    SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                    MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-58-MATCH-ON-VEH-SHIP-RT-CARR.

           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
             OR FREIGHT-DELV-CARR  = SPACES
              SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
              INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
           ELSE
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO RAIL-CAR-ARG
              MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE TO DATE-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-VS
              IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN.

           PERFORM UNTIL MATCH-FOUND OR MATCH-NOT-FOUND
              IF DAPPL-RAIL-CAR = FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM
                AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE = FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE
                 IF DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER = FREIGHT-DELV-CARR
                    SET MATCH-FOUND TO TRUE
                    MOVE IO-RECNUM TO DAPPLFRT-RRN
                 ELSE
                    PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
                    IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                       SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                       INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 SET MATCH-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
                 INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, DAPPLFRT-RRN
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.

       7-60-WRITE-MANL-TO-DAPPLFRT.
      *    DISPLAY "7-60-WRITE-MANL-TO-DAPPLFRT".
           INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAID-DATE   TO DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE   TO DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO DAPPL-RAIL-CAR.
           MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS       TO DAPPL-TERMS.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR    TO DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER.
           MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM      TO DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES     TO DAPPL-PAID-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE            TO DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE.

           PERFORM 9999-WRITE-DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O.

       7-61-APPLY-PAID-NOT-RATED.
      *    DISPLAY "7-61-APPLY-PAID-NOT-RATED".
           INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, TOTAL-FRT-TAX.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14          TO DAPPL-PO-14.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAID-DATE      TO DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE      TO DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM    TO DAPPL-RAIL-CAR.
           MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS          TO DAPPL-TERMS.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR       TO DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER.
           MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM         TO DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES        TO DAPPL-PAID-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE               TO DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE,
                                          DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE.
           MOVE CUR-TIME               TO DAPPL-PAID-APPL-TIME.

           IF FREIGHT-CHARGES NOT = ZERO
              MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES TO AMT-TO-APPLY, PAID-AMT
              CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                     PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                          FROM-PGM-NAME.

           MOVE TOTAL-FRT-TAX          TO DAPPL-PAID-TAX.
           PERFORM 9999-WRITE-DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O.

       7-62-APPLY-RATED-NOT-PAID.
      *    DISPLAY "7-62-APPLY-RATED-NOT-PAID".
           INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14       TO DAPPL-PO-14.
           MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE   TO DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO DAPPL-RAIL-CAR.
           MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS       TO DAPPL-TERMS.
           MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR   TO DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER.
           MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM      TO DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES     TO DAPPL-RATED-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE            TO DAPPL-RATED-RCV-DATE
                                       DAPPL-RATED-APPL-DATE.
           MOVE CUR-TIME            TO DAPPL-RATED-APPL-TIME.

      *----ONLY UPDATE DTRANS AND MMATL-ACCUM IF AN AMT HAS BEEN RATED.

           IF FREIGHT-CHARGES NOT = 0
              MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES TO AMT-TO-APPLY
              MOVE 0 TO PAID-AMT
              CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                     PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                           FROM-PGM-NAME.

           PERFORM 9999-WRITE-DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O.

       7-63-APPLY-PAID-AFTER-RATED.
      *    DISPLAY "7-63-APPLY-PAID-AFTER-RATED".
           PERFORM  9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-EQ-RRN.

           INITIALIZE TOTAL-FRT-TAX.
           IF DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14       TO DAPPL-PO-14.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAID-DATE      TO DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE.
           IF FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE   TO DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM NOT  = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO DAPPL-RAIL-CAR.
           IF FREIGHT-TERMS NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS       TO DAPPL-TERMS.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR       TO DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER.
           MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM         TO DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES        TO DAPPL-PAID-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE               TO DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE
                                          DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE.
           MOVE CUR-TIME               TO DAPPL-PAID-APPL-TIME.

      *----IN CASE TIS DIDN'T SEND IT, LOAD DAPPL-PO TO FREIGHT-PO.
      *----THIS WILL ENSURE THAT DTRANS HAS THE NEEDED INFORMATION.

           MOVE DAPPL-PO-14 TO FREIGHT-PO-14.

           COMPUTE AMT-TO-APPLY = DAPPL-PAID-AMT - DAPPL-RATED-AMT.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT TO PAID-AMT.

           IF SAVE-PAY-FRT-TAX = "Y"
              IF AMT-TO-APPLY  = ZERO AND PAID-AMT = ZERO
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                        PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                             FROM-PGM-NAME.
           IF SAVE-PAY-FRT-TAX NOT = "Y"
              IF AMT-TO-APPLY = ZERO
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                        PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                             FROM-PGM-NAME.

           MOVE TOTAL-FRT-TAX TO DAPPL-PAID-TAX.
           PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-RRN-O.

       7-64-APPLY-EXTRA-PAYMENT.
      *    DISPLAY "7-64-APPLY-EXTRA-PAYMENT".

      *----TWO PAYMENTS FOR THE SAME PO-RCVR SHOULD NOT OCCUR
      *----ON THE SAME DATE.  THIS IS A "TIS" ERROR.

           MOVE "N" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           MOVE "N" TO DOUBLE-PAYMENT.

      *----IN CASE TIS DIDN'T SEND IT, LOAD DAPPL-PO TO FREIGHT-PO.

           IF FREIGHT-PO-13 = SPACES
              MOVE DAPPL-PO-14 TO FREIGHT-PO-14.

      *----IF HAVE THE PO, CHECK IF ANY RECS
      *----MATCH ON PO-RCVR AND PAID-DATE

           IF FREIGHT-PO-13 > SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14 TO PO-14-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-PO

              PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
                 IF DAPPL-PO-14 = FREIGHT-PO-14
                    IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE = FREIGHT-PAID-DATE

      *----------------CHECK NEW POSITIVE PAYMENTS AGAINST PREVIOUS
      *----------------POSITIVE PAYMENTS

                       IF FREIGHT-CHARGES >= ZERO
                          IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT >= ZERO
                             MOVE "Y" TO DOUBLE-PAYMENT
                             MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
                          ELSE
                             PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PO-I
                          END-IF

      *----------------CHECK NEW NEGATIVE PAYMENTS AGAINST PREVIOUS
      *----------------NEGATIVE PAYMENTS

                       ELSE
                          IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT < ZERO
                             MOVE "Y" TO DOUBLE-PAYMENT
                             MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
                          ELSE
                             PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PO-I
                          END-IF
                       END-IF
                    ELSE
                       PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PO-I
                    END-IF
                 ELSE
                    MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
                    INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT
                 END-IF
              END-PERFORM

      *-------IF ANY RECS MATCH ON DATE, WRITE TO ERROR FILE

      *       IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE = FREIGHT-PAID-DATE
              IF DOUBLE-PAYMENT = "Y"
                 MOVE "MULTI PAYMENT FND ON SAME RCVR & PAID DATE(7-64)"
                   TO ERR-MSG
                 MOVE "641" TO ERR-CODE
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
                 MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
                 WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
                 GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

      *----IF DON'T HAVE PO, CHECK IF ANY RECS
      *----MATCH ON RAIL-CAR, SHIP-DATE AND PAID-DATE

           IF FREIGHT-PO-13 = SPACES

              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO RAIL-CAR-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-CAR
              PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I

              PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"

                 IF DAPPL-RAIL-CAR = FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM
                    IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE >= MIN-SHIP-DATE
                       AND DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE <= MAX-SHIP-DATE
                       IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE = FREIGHT-PAID-DATE

      *----------------CHECK NEW POSITIVE PAYMENTS AGAINST PREVIOUS
      *----------------POSITIVE PAYMENTS

                       IF FREIGHT-CHARGES >= ZERO
                          IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT >= ZERO
                             MOVE "Y" TO DOUBLE-PAYMENT
                             MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
                          ELSE
                             PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                          END-IF

      *----------------CHECK NEW NEGATIVE PAYMENTS AGAINST PREVIOUS
      *----------------NEGATIVE PAYMENTS

                       ELSE
                          IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT < ZERO
                             MOVE "Y" TO DOUBLE-PAYMENT
                             MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
                          ELSE
                             PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                          END-IF
                       END-IF
                       ELSE
                          PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                       END-IF
                    ELSE
                       PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I
                    END-IF
                 ELSE
                    MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
                    INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT
                 END-IF
              END-PERFORM

      *-------IF ANY RECS MATCH ON DATE, WRITE TO ERROR FILE

      *       IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE = FREIGHT-PAID-DATE
              IF DOUBLE-PAYMENT = "Y"
                 MOVE "MULTI PAYMENT FND ON SAME CAR, SHIP & PAID DATE"
                   TO ERR-MSG
                 MOVE "642" TO ERR-CODE
                 MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
                 MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
                 WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
                 GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

      *----IF NO RECS MATCH ON DATE, CREATE SECOND PAYMENT REC.

           INITIALIZE BUF-DAPPLFRT, TOTAL-FRT-TAX.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14          TO DAPPL-PO-14.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAID-DATE      TO DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE      TO DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM    TO DAPPL-RAIL-CAR.
           MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS          TO DAPPL-TERMS.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR       TO DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER.
           MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM         TO DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES        TO DAPPL-PAID-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE               TO DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE.

      *----IF THIS IS A "MANL" FREIGHT RECORD WRITE IT TO DAPPLFRT
      *----FOR LATER RATING. OTHERWISE APPLY THE CHARGES NOW.

           IF FREIGHT-PO-13 NOT = SPACES
              MOVE CUR-DATE            TO DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE
              MOVE CUR-TIME            TO DAPPL-PAID-APPL-TIME
              IF FREIGHT-CHARGES NOT = ZERO
                 MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES TO AMT-TO-APPLY, PAID-AMT
                 CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                        PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                             FROM-PGM-NAME
                 MOVE TOTAL-FRT-TAX    TO DAPPL-PAID-TAX.

           PERFORM 9999-WRITE-DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O.

       7-65-PROCESS-NEW-RATED-AMT.
      *    DISPLAY "7-65-PROCESS-NEW-RATED-AMT".
           PERFORM  9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-EQ-RRN.

      *----CAN'T APPLY NEW FREIGHT RATED AMT IF ANY OF THESE ARE TRUE.
      *----      NEW FREIGHT RATED AMOUNT IS ZERO
      *----      DAPPLFRT ALREADY RATED (AMOUNT NOT ZERO)

           IF FREIGHT-CHARGES  = 0
              MOVE "TRYING TO RE-RATE DAPPLFRT AMT TO ZERO (7-65)"
                 TO ERR-MSG
              MOVE "651" TO ERR-CODE
              MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
              MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
              WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
              GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

           IF DAPPL-RATED-AMT NOT = 0
              MOVE "TRYING TO RATE ALREADY RATED DAPPLFRT (7-65)"
                 TO ERR-MSG
              MOVE "652" TO ERR-CODE
              MOVE CUR-DATE TO ERR-DATE
              MOVE BUF-FREIGHT TO ERR-RECORD
              WRITE ERROR-REC-O FROM BUF-ERROR
              GO TO 7-6-EXIT.

           IF FREIGHT-PO-13 NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14 TO DAPPL-PO-14.
           IF FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE TO DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM TO DAPPL-RAIL-CAR.
           IF FREIGHT-TERMS NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS TO DAPPL-TERMS.
           IF FREIGHT-DELV-CARR NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR TO DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER.
           IF FREIGHT-FB-NUM NOT = SPACES
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM TO DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES TO DAPPL-RATED-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE        TO DAPPL-RATED-RCV-DATE
                                   DAPPL-RATED-APPL-DATE.
           MOVE CUR-TIME        TO DAPPL-RATED-APPL-TIME.

           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES TO AMT-TO-APPLY.
           MOVE 0 TO PAID-AMT.
           CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                  PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                       FROM-PGM-NAME.

           PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-RRN-O.

       7-66-APPLY-MANL-NOW-RATED.
      *    DISPLAY "7-66-APPLY-MANL-NOW-RATED".
           PERFORM  9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-EQ-RRN.

           INITIALIZE TOTAL-FRT-TAX.
           MOVE FREIGHT-PO-14            TO DAPPL-PO-14.
           MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR        TO DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER.
           MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM           TO DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO.
           MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES          TO DAPPL-RATED-AMT.
           MOVE CUR-DATE                 TO DAPPL-RATED-RCV-DATE
                                            DAPPL-RATED-APPL-DATE
                                            DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE.
           MOVE CUR-TIME                 TO DAPPL-RATED-APPL-TIME
                                            DAPPL-PAID-APPL-TIME.
           IF DAPPL-STATUS-1 = "X"
              MOVE SPACE                 TO DAPPL-STATUS-1
              MOVE CUR-DATE              TO DAPPL-STATUS-DATE.

           IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT NOT = ZERO
              MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT TO AMT-TO-APPLY, PAID-AMT
              CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                     PAID-AMT,   TOTAL-FRT-TAX,
                                          FROM-PGM-NAME.

           MOVE TOTAL-FRT-TAX            TO DAPPL-PAID-TAX.
           PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-RRN-O.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       9999-UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       9999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TFRTPROC" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
              VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
              BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

      *---------------------------------
      * DAPPLFRT
      *---------------------------------

      *-SEQUENTIAL----------------------

       9999-WRITE-DAPPLFRT-SEQ-O.
           WRITE DAPPLFRT-SEQ-REC-O FROM BUF-DAPPLFRT.

      *-KEY=REL REC NUM-----------------

       9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-EQ-RRN.
           READ DAPPLFRT-RRN-O INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-RRN-O.
           REWRITE DAPPLFRT-RRN-REC-O FROM BUF-DAPPLFRT
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE MACCOUNT-INFO*9999-RMIO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE "RRN = "     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DAPPLFRT-RRN TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *-KEY=PO--------------------------

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PO-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-PO-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-PO.
           MOVE PO-14-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DAPPLFRT-PO-REC-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-PO-I INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      *-KEY=CAR-------------------------

       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-CAR.
           MOVE RAIL-CAR-ARG TO FRTRAILCAR OF DAPPLFRT-CAR-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-CAR-I KEY = FRTRAILCAR OF DAPPLFRT-CAR-REC-I
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-CAR*9999-SDIEC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE RAIL-CAR-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-CAR-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-CAR-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      *-KEY=PCP-------------------------

       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-PCP.
           MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO PDCARRIER OF DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           MOVE PRO-NO-ARG  TO PDPRONO   OF DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-PCP-I KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-PCP*9999-SDIEP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE PRO-NO-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-PCP-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      *-KEY=RCP-------------------------

       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-RCP.
           MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO RTCARRIER OF DAPPLFRT-RCP-REC-I.
           MOVE PRO-NO-ARG  TO RTPRONO   OF DAPPLFRT-RCP-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-RCP-I KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-RCP*9999-SDIER" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE PRO-NO-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-RCP-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-RCP-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      *-KEY=VS--------------------------

       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-EQ-VS.
           MOVE RAIL-CAR-ARG TO FRTRAILCAR OF DAPPLFRT-VS-REC-I.
           MOVE DATE-ARG     TO TISSHIPDT  OF DAPPLFRT-VS-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-VS-I KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-VS*9999-SDIEV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE RAIL-CAR-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE DATE-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-VS-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      *---------------------------------
      * MACCOUNT-INFO
      *---------------------------------

       9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE MACCT-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-O.
           READ MACCOUNT-INFO-O INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ MACCOUNT-INFO*9999-RMIKO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE MACCT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-REWRITE-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           REWRITE MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MACCT-INFO
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE MACCOUNT-INFO*9999-RMIO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE MACCT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-RESET-MACCOUNT-INFO-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-O.
           START MACCOUNT-INFO-O KEY >
              INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-REC-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

